{"id":"0dd7c9b3e61cc21b","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-contradiction.md","title":"Contradiction $\bot$","display":"df-contradiction — Contradiction $\bot$","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-contradiction","aliases":["92-df-contradiction"],"display":"df-contradiction — Contradiction $\bot$","depends_on":["[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-signature]]"],"source":"本地理论与有限演算背景；原书第 III 章 pp.28–30 和第 V 章 pp.56–64 可作概念对照，以下闭包/演绎呈现不是原书逐字定义","source_status":"原书相关背景的本地理论定义或推论"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-contradiction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-contradiction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-contradiction — Contradiction <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\bot\">\\(\bot\\)</span>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地理论与有限演算背景；原书第 III 章 pp.28–30 和第 V 章 pp.56–64 可作概念对照，以下闭包/演绎呈现不是原书逐字定义"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书相关背景的本地理论定义或推论"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-contradiction-—-Contradiction-$\\bot$\">df-contradiction — Contradiction <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0,S\">\\(0,S\\)</span> (zero and successor symbols of the fixed signature, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_G\">\\(\\bot_G\\)</span> (definition-target contradiction sentence)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}contradiction} \\vdash \\bot_G\\coloneqq(0=S(0))\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}contradiction} \\vdash \\bot_G\\coloneqq(0=S(0))\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_G\">\\(\\bot_G\\)</span> : 选定的算术矛盾句<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0=S(0)\">\\(0=S(0)\\)</span></li>\n<li>一致性可通过“选定的矛盾句<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_G\">\\(\\bot_G\\)</span>不可证”来表达</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0=S(0)\">\\(0=S(0)\\)</span>在标准自然数模型中为假；任何证明<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\\,S(x)\\neq0\">\\(\\forall x\\,S(x)\\neq0\\)</span>的理论都可反驳它</li>\n<li>本定义只固定矛盾句；内部一致性句另见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"68f172d58c15e75d\" href=\"?note=68f172d58c15e75d\" title=\"92-df-consistency-statement\">92-df-consistency-statement</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-contradiction-—-Contradiction-$\\bot$","text":"df-contradiction — Contradiction $\\bot$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":